ulate the area of the triangle\narea = (1/2) * PR * QR * sin_alpha\nprint(area)\n```\n```output\n98.0\n```\nThe smallest possible area of $\\triangle PQR$ is \\(\\boxed{98 \\text{ cm}^2}\\).",
